# Module Complete Gate — phpupgrade

**Never mark a module ✅ complete** from list/index screens alone.

## Scope — Which Modules to Test

Test **only modules already started** in this upgrade (fixes + `phase4_*` scripts exist). Do **not** run deep-link sweeps on untouched modules from `PHP_UPGRADE_PLAN.md`.

| Module | Status (2026-07-07) | Deep-link script |
|--------|---------------------|------------------|
| 1 Auth | Upgraded — deep-links PASS | `phase4_auth_links_test.php` |
| 2 Welcome | Upgraded — deep-links PASS | `phase4_welcome_links_test.php` |
| 3 POS | Upgraded — deep-links PASS | `phase4_pos_links_test.php` |
